      <title>Bison Week: Soundcheck - State Fair at The Yard  (Upper Quad)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53443921946744/huge/900d9c476d2b1d894cd8c935c7794f2c43a4cb56.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Tue, 11 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Bison Week Soundcheck State Fair is an opportunity to introduce students to the regionally diverse makeup of Howard University’s campus. Students will get to meet various state clubs, learn about the culture of different regions such as the South, West Coast, East Coast, and Midwest, while enjoying an exciting environment similar to a local state fair.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>The fair will feature tabling from various state clubs as well as individual club presentations on the steps of Douglass Hall to teach local dance styles and culture.</p>

